            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF152 adds support for the <a href=\"https://github.com/tc39/proposal-iterator-includes\">TC39 Iterator proposal</a> in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2025779\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2025779</a> behind pref <code class=\"notranslate\">javascript.options.experimental.iterator_includes</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note and an experimental features entry.<br>\nThe docs are being done in a separate PR.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4469264809\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44158\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44158/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44158\">#44158</a></p>",
