        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50140049?u=d1f6deb8c04128f250df0ed83405f16c3b98e4fb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Clarified the explanation of the <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"organization\" data-hovercard-url=\"/orgs/layer/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/layer\">@layer</a> at-rule, emphasizing the precedence of styles and the creation of anonymous layers. Improved the wording for better understanding.</p>\n\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For clarity the order of the descriptions are slightly reordered. Also the three types of <code class=\"notranslate\">@layer</code> usage is defined more clearly with named sections.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For clarity and better understanding and exploring the impacts of layering.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The original description was not incorrect but a slight change in order and better description and comparison with normal behaviour should make the uscase a bit clearer</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
