        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removes the statement from the <code class=\"notranslate\">proxy</code> API that it was unavailable on the <code class=\"notranslate\">chrome</code> namespace.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4489091617\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mozilla/extension-workshop/issues/2336\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mozilla/extension-workshop/pull/2336/hovercard?comment_id=3276462438&amp;comment_type=review_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mozilla/extension-workshop/pull/2336#discussion_r3276462438\">mozilla/extension-workshop#2336 (comment)</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44225",
            "title": "Remove statements about APIs not supporting `chrome` namespace",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-22T16:57:47.000Z",
