        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">the <code class=\"notranslate\">will-change</code> property, included in our docs<br>\nit is defined in <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-will-change-1/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-will-change-1/</a><br>\nadding a module page for that spec.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">will-change hasn't rececived a major update since before we were on github, likely since 2014, so did a refresh to make it follow our general mdn guidelines</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44210",
            "title": "New CSS module page: will change",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-21T10:56:55.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-21T10:53:47.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "estelle",
                "url": "https://github.com/estelle"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67853915?u=b89a27cada6c514dfa518e1c064be780f0702ef8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">JPEG-XL is now supported in Firefox Beta and Developer Edition (found out through my own testing).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">This will allow readers to be informed about the state of the format's support, which is relevant because of the data savings the format can enable.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Since Firefox 152 Stable has not come out yet, I'm not sure if its row should be filled out or left blank, but the other rows should definitely be updated since the versions in those rows (Beta and Developer Edition) have been released.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None that I could find.</p>\n\n\n\n",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44205",
            "title": "Add update on JPEG-XL support",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-20T18:24:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-20T18:23:34.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "jacob-willden",
                "url": "https://github.com/jacob-willden"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/201253672?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds the missing SVG <code class=\"notranslate\">offset</code> attribute reference page.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">{{SVGAttr(\"offset\")}}</code> macro was linking to a non-existent page across several SVG and Web API reference pages, resulting in broken links.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Changes made</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added <code class=\"notranslate\">/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Reference/Attribute/offset</code></li>\n<li>Included usage description and example</li>\n<li>Added related SVG elements and references</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Issue addressed</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Fixes broken SVG attribute reference links for <code class=\"notranslate\">offset</code>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44200",
            "title": "Add missing SVG offset attribute reference page",
            "date_modified": "2026-05-20T12:07:15.000Z",
            "date_published": "2026-05-20T12:05:41.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "pavithra-r06",
                "url": "https://github.com/pavithra-r06"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38193798?u=51a29a96b848dcb858148a9940509bf1d87c682a&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">untangle the computed value for <code class=\"notranslate\">border-*-width</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">column-rule-width</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">outline-width</code> from their related <code class=\"notranslate\">*-style</code> properties.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2784905702\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494/hovercard?comment_id=2675800489&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/11494#issuecomment-2675800489\">w3c/csswg-drafts#11494 (comment)</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Relates <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4480621675\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44193\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/44193/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44193\">#44193</a><br>\nRelates <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4413852604\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/issues/1069\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/data/pull/1069/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/data/pull/1069\">mdn/data#1069</a></p>",
